' handleBack: Handles the Back button (also used for a remote control Back). Returns true if the screen handled it
' itself, for example by closing a panel or itself; otherwise the screen is closed for it. Screens with their own
' Back behavior override this.
function handleBack() as boolean
    return false
end function

function onKeyEvent(key as string, press as boolean) as boolean
    if not press then return false

    return false
end function
